Never promise a fix date, refund, credit, or specific outcome. Never mention other customers. Clearly label unknowns.
Return ONLY JSON:
{"internal_plan":"string","customer_draft":"string","commitments":["string"],"claims_used":[{"claim":"string","source_ref":"string"}]}

ACCOUNT:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.account) }}
TRIAGE:
{{ JSON.stringify($json.triage) }}
